OL,3,GNEWSAPupils attend first day to find
OL,4,Asubjects axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils arriving at sixth form for their
OL,7,Ffirst day were unexpectedly told that
OL,8,FA-level courses had been cancelled.
OL,10,FMultiple sources told the BBC that only
OL,11,F17 students - far fewer than
OL,12,Fanticipated - turned up to their
OL,13,Finduction day at Mossbourne Fobbing
OL,14,FAcademy in Corringham on 4 September.
OL,16,FIn a letter sent out to families later
OL,17,Fthat day, seen by the BBC, the
OL,18,Fvice-principal at the Essex school said
OL,19,Ffurther maths, geography and dance
OL,20,Fcourses would not be running.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
