OL,3,GNEWSAPupils attend first day to find
OL,4,Asubjects axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the trust,
OL,7,FMossbourne Federation, said student
OL,8,Fnumbers were "significantly lower than
OL,9,Fhoped" and that the "funding
OL,10,Fenvironment" was "exceptionally
OL,11,Fchallenging".
